# Whitelist repository: everything is ignored unless explicitly allowed.
# The working folder holds private dev notes, test checklists, release
# archives and build output that must never reach the public repo.
/*

# --- plugin source ---
# ★Everything CMakeLists.txt compiles must be here. Fallback.* and api/ were
# excluded as "dead in build", and both had stopped being that: Fallback is the
# 2D icon path (main/Editor/Equip/Grid all call it) and api/ carries HostApi.cpp
# — all four are named in the source list, so a clone could not build. Before
# adding an exclusion here, check the file against CMakeLists first.
!/plugin/
/plugin/*
!/plugin/src/
!/plugin/CMakeLists.txt
!/plugin/vcpkg.json

# --- docs shipped with the mod ---
!/README_KO.md
!/README_EN.md
!/CREDITS.md
!/LICENSE-GPL
!/EXCEPTIONS.txt

# --- docs for mod authors ---
# ★These are the API contract, and they have to be public: README.md links
# them, and an author reading the repo is exactly who they are for. The header
# they describe (plugin/src/api/GridInventoryAPI.h) is already allowed above.
!/API_COSTUME.md
!/API_COSTUME_KO.md

# --- deliberately NOT here ---
# Grid Inventory.esp is the mod's DATA and ships on Nexus, not from source.
# The plugin references its FormIDs directly (coins 0x800.., bags 0x818..,
# costume anchors 0x82B..0x84A), so a clone builds but those features stay
# inert without the released archive. That is the intended split: this repo
# is the source, not a playable copy.

# --- repo files ---
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
